#. (itstool) path: component/name
#: org.kde.merkuro.mail.metainfo.xml:10
msgid "Merkuro Mail"
msgstr "Merkuro Mail"

#. (itstool) path: component/summary
#: org.kde.merkuro.mail.metainfo.xml:11
msgid "Read and write emails"
msgstr "Lea e escriba por correo"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.merkuro.mail.metainfo.xml:18
msgid ""
"Merkuro Mail is a free and open source email client. Merkuro Mail is part of "
"the Merkuro groupware suite and is currently in beta. For now, it only "
"allows you to read your emails."
msgstr ""
"Merkuro Mail é un cliente de correo libre e de balde que forma parte da "
"colección de programas de traballo en equipo Merkuro, e está en fase de "
"probas. De momento só permite ler o correo."

#. (itstool) path: ul/li
#: org.kde.merkuro.mail.metainfo.xml:38
msgid ""
"Reply, reply to all, and forward messages from the message and folder views."
msgstr ""

#. (itstool) path: ul/li
#: org.kde.merkuro.mail.metainfo.xml:39
msgid ""
"Schedule messages for later or queue them for manual sending, with options "
"to send now or reschedule from Drafts and Outbox."
msgstr ""

#. (itstool) path: ul/li
#: org.kde.merkuro.mail.metainfo.xml:40
msgid "Show scheduled send times and manual send status in the message list."
msgstr ""

#. (itstool) path: ul/li
#: org.kde.merkuro.mail.metainfo.xml:41
msgid ""
"Group messages into optional threads, showing combined senders and unread "
"message counts, sorted by the latest message."
msgstr ""

#. (itstool) path: ul/li
#: org.kde.merkuro.mail.metainfo.xml:42
msgid "Permanently delete messages from Trash."
msgstr ""

#. (itstool) path: ul/li
#: org.kde.merkuro.mail.metainfo.xml:43
msgid ""
"Update a folder alone or together with its subfolders, and restart an "
"account from the folder menu."
msgstr ""

#. (itstool) path: ul/li
#: org.kde.merkuro.mail.metainfo.xml:44
msgid ""
"Show Merkuro Mail in the application launcher and improve message ordering, "
"sidebar sizing, and stability."
msgstr ""

